      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks to me a little bit more complex than need be ; we could just document maybeUpdateProxy to take null for oldLp if the old network was not connected. This sounds like a natural contract for that method, probably a more natural one than to leave that decision to this method.\n\nThe followup has this new `applyInitialLinkProperties()` which simply calls `updateLinkProperties` with a null oldLp. I don\u0027t know if the general direction is going to be to separate the two methods or consecrate that `updateLinkProperties` with a null oldLp is the way to do one-time init, but either way a null oldLp passed to maybeUpdateProxy looks simpler to me.",
