      "message": "In fact I think it probably fixes a bug.\n\nThere is one corner case that is obfuscated now : if the agent is registered with some properties and updates them before it connects with a different proxy, I think the old code would send the proxy broadcast. I think your code fixes this.\n\nHowever, I think it could be made much clearer by just not calling maybeUpdateProxy if !networkAgent.everConnected().",
